Spec: Focused Windows runtime ownership verification

Purpose:
  Exercise sharing, independent cancellation, capacity, late startup and cleanup without running unrelated suites.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Runtime.Tests.csproj
  ./Program.cs

Must:
  Verify confirmed server settings, canonical addresses and explicit STUN/fingerprint rejection with locally issued public certificates only.
  Verify empty owned logs can be removed while a cleanup path outside its explicitly owned root is rejected.
  Use deterministic clocks and owned fake resources with bounded waits, no cloud access or installed service changes.
  Verify a cancelled waiter preserves another waiter, retired resources retain capacity until disposed, failed cleanup can retry, and close/clock rollback reject new work.
